From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] WebCore/platform: draw, lay out text and load on a 2012
 system

The platform layer on iOS 6: the CoreGraphics and CoreText paths that predate
what WebKit assumes, WAK and the web thread, the surfaces the compositor hands
to CoreAnimation, networking over CFNetwork of this release, PAL's soft links
for frameworks that are absent or older, and HAVE_* gates turned off for what
this system does not have.
